            {
              "text": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>INSTRUCCIONES DE REGISTRO Y RECARGA DE TARJETAS&nbsp; A TRAV&Eacute;S DE LA WEB DE TRANSPORTE URBANO DE LOGRO&Ntilde;O</strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://transporteurbano.logrono.es\">transporteurbano.logrono.es</a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Tarjetas existentes</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span>Haber validado un viaje en el autob&uacute;s despu&eacute;s del 26 de junio de 2026.</li>\n<li class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Registrarse en la web (datos personales, correo electr&oacute;nico). Se enviar&aacute; un correo de verificaci&oacute;n de la direcci&oacute;n electr&oacute;nica para registrarse correctamente.</li>\n<li class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><!-- [if gte vml 1]><v:rect id=\"Entrada_x0020_de_x0020_lápiz_x0020_4\"\n o:spid=\"_x0000_s1027\" style='position:absolute;left:0;text-align:left;\n margin-left:274.95pt;margin-top:3.6pt;width:1.45pt;height:1.45pt;z-index:251660288;\n visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:square;mso-wrap-distance-left:9pt;\n mso-wrap-distance-top:0;mso-wrap-distance-right:9pt;\n mso-wrap-distance-bottom:0;mso-position-horizontal:absolute;\n mso-position-horizontal-relative:text;mso-position-vertical:absolute;\n mso-position-vertical-relative:text' coordsize=\"1,1\" filled=\"f\" strokecolor=\"#e71224\"\n strokeweight=\".5mm\">\n <v:stroke endcap=\"round\"/>\n <v:path shadowok=\"f\" o:extrusionok=\"f\" fillok=\"f\" insetpenok=\"f\"/>\n <o:lock v:ext=\"edit\" rotation=\"t\" aspectratio=\"t\" verticies=\"t\" text=\"t\"\n  shapetype=\"t\"/>\n <o:ink i=\"AGUdAgYGARBYz1SK5pfFT48G+LrS4ZsiAwtIEETnpZABRTJGMgUDOAtkGSMyCoHH//8PgMf//w8z\nCoHH//8PgMf//w84CQD+/wMAAAAAAAoWAgEAAQAQX/9AAAoAESAQU8eERBTdAR==\n\" annotation=\"t\"/>\n</v:rect><![endif]--><!-- [if !vml]--><span style=\"mso-ignore: vglayout; position: relative; z-index: 251660288;\"><span style=\"left: 360px; position: absolute; top: -1px; width: 14px; height: 14px;\"><img src=\"file:///C:/Users/LOCAL_~1/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.png\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\"></span></span><!--[endif]-->Iniciar sesi&oacute;n con usuario y contrase&ntilde;a</li>\n<li class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]-->Entrar en la pesta&ntilde;a Mis tarjetas.<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" title=\"mistarjetas\" src=\"https://transporteurbano.logrono.es/cms/uploads/mistarjetas_1ffdbf2353.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"843\" height=\"420\"></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\"><!-- [if gte vml 1]><v:rect id=\"Entrada_x0020_de_x0020_lápiz_x0020_3\"\n o:spid=\"_x0000_s1026\" style='position:absolute;left:0;text-align:left;\n margin-left:604.1pt;margin-top:45.2pt;width:1.45pt;height:1.45pt;z-index:251659264;\n visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:square;mso-wrap-distance-left:9pt;\n mso-wrap-distance-top:0;mso-wrap-distance-right:9pt;\n mso-wrap-distance-bottom:0;mso-position-horizontal:absolute;\n mso-position-horizontal-relative:text;mso-position-vertical:absolute;\n mso-position-vertical-relative:text' coordorigin=\"1,1\" coordsize=\"1,1\"\n filled=\"f\" strokecolor=\"#e71224\" strokeweight=\".5mm\">\n <v:stroke endcap=\"round\"/>\n <v:path shadowok=\"f\" o:extrusionok=\"f\" fillok=\"f\" insetpenok=\"f\"/>\n <o:lock v:ext=\"edit\" rotation=\"t\" aspectratio=\"t\" verticies=\"t\" text=\"t\"\n  shapetype=\"t\"/>\n <o:ink i=\"AGUdAgYGARBYz1SK5pfFT48G+LrS4ZsiAwtIEETnpZABRTJGMgUDOAtkGSMyCoHH//8PgMf//w8z\nCoHH//8PgMf//w84CQD+/wMAAAAAAAoWAgJQAlAQX/9AAAoAESCQnjOERBTdAR==\n\" annotation=\"t\"/>\n</v:rect><![endif]--><!-- [if !vml]--><span style=\"mso-ignore: vglayout; position: absolute; z-index: 251659264; left: 0px; margin-left: 799px; margin-top: 54px; width: 14px; height: 14px;\"><img src=\"file:///C:/Users/LOCAL_~1/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image002.png\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\"></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\"><!--[endif]--></span><!-- [if !supportLists]-->Clicar en la pesta&ntilde;a a&ntilde;adir nueva tarjeta</li>\n<li class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span>Introducir n&uacute;mero de serie de tu tarjeta</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\"><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" title=\"numerotarjeta\" src=\"https://transporteurbano.logrono.es/cms/uploads/numero_tarjeta_0ffd09cd30.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"564\" height=\"327\"><br><!--[endif]--></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\">&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span>Una vez asociada la tarjeta clicar en ella la opci&oacute;n recargar (&uacute;nicamente 10 viajes)</li>\n<li class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span>Pagar con un m&eacute;todo de pago registrado (si se quiere guardar para futuras recargas) o con un m&eacute;todo de pago no registrado (no se guardar&aacute; para futuras recargas)</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;IMPORTANTE:</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></span>Para terminar la recarga en la tarjeta y que aparezca el total de los viajes en la web deber&aacute;s validar un viaje en el autob&uacute;s y se actualizar&aacute; autom&aacute;ticamente el saldo (ser&aacute; visible en el pupitre del autob&uacute;s y posteriormente en la web).</li>\n<li>Es necesario que transcurran <strong>15 minutos</strong> entre la recarga y la validaci&oacute;n de la tarjeta en el autob&uacute;s para que la regarga sea efectiva.</li>\n<li>Las tarjetas que no hayan sido usadas con posterioridad al 26 de julio y cuyo saldo sea de 0 viajes no se podr&aacute;n registrar en la web hasta que no pasen por un autob&uacute;s, para lo cual es necesario que realicen previamente una recarga en un punto de venta f&iacute;sico.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Tarjetas nuevas</strong> (actualmente adquiridas en puntos de recarga, 010, punto de informaci&oacute;n Avda. Solidaridad, oficinas AULOSA):</p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Deber&aacute;n ser recargadas f&iacute;sicamente y validar la primera vez en el autob&uacute;s para posteriormente poder registrar/recargar en la web.</li>\n</ul>",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "title": "INSTRUCCIONES PARA EL REGISTRO Y RECARGA DE LAS TARJETAS DE TRANSPORTE",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-01T13:14:18.051Z"
    }
